// Dialog :
"P3637430751" "Thanks, {HeroName}.  Hopefully things will quiet down around here for awhile.  That should give us time to investigate the spell that's drawing Salamanca into the spirit world."
// RandomFameString :
"P2692483226" "{HeroName} is sure giving the Tuatha de Dannan a run for their money!"

