// IntroString :
"P4167358848" "I just got word from Gordon Bower, mayor of Salamanca.  Apparently the Fir Bolg have gotten their hands on a book of runes that the Salamancans were using to keep the worst of the monsters out of the village.  They need that book back, and bad. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you go and retrieve it?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1338779268" "Retrieve the book"
// SendOffString :
"P3331339275" "Salamanca houses the Occult Studies annex for Paragon City University.  It's a good thing they had a few mystical artifacts on hand when their village started to be drawn into Croatoa."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part1 
